  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Suppose ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},{X}_{3}$ is an I.I.D random sample with ${X}_{i}∼\\text{Exp}(\\theta )$ and unknown rate parameter $\\theta .$ The log-likelihood function of the sample $5.1,\\,4.2,\\,6.3$ is\n\n$$\nl(\\theta )=a\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\theta +b\\theta .\n$$\n\nWhat is the value of $a+b?$",
